<<~ ahu slot=`#/a8f6058d0-ci-both-red`>>

!! a8f6058d0 CI (runs 43142190718 CI, 43142190654 held-out): both red
All three reds survive glass2, with the same signatures:
* ''node-b:'' surface-mount-real-island, `unsaved at teardown: "$:/StoryList"`;
* ''witness rest:'' two-phase-boot T5, same fault;
* ''held-out:'' weld M5, LIVENESS.

''New on a8f6058d0, web-tw5:'' golden-whole-road e2e W1–W6 all fail. W1 calls `closeTiddler("GettingStarted")` and gets `Cannot read properties of null (reading 'click')`; W2–W6 fail behind it.
* ''Why:'' since 18c05e779 the floor replays into every island, so the worker opens the wiki's own landing (`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/welcome`), not stock's GettingStarted.
* ''Which side was wrong:'' the test. The product now does what glass2 intended; the golden still expected the stock story.
* ''Cure:'' `6f097dc94 lar:///golden.reads.landing/whole-road`. W1 closes every title the opened story holds. Not run locally (e2e law); only CI can prove it.

<<~/ahu>>

